WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.874
Open Lessons, then Homework. This feature is for Elementary classes.

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.970
Check the assigned meeting. Homework is due one week later.

00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:13.355
Choose Publish homework, then add a title and clear instructions.

00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:18.684
Add a named worksheet link, and check its sharing permissions.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:25.723
Select Publish homework and wait for the saved assignment to appear.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:30.128
At the next meeting, mark work as Completed or Not completed.

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.691
Leave children you haven’t reviewed unrecorded, then choose Save completion.

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:40.068
Check the saved roster and school-year history before you leave.
